    Q("p. 58", ("Which sentence is correct?", "Kalimat mana yang benar?"), ["昨天我吃了早饭就去教室。", "昨天我吃了早饭就去教室了。"], 1,
      ("The teacher's correction adds 了 at the end, because 昨天 already happened.", "Koreksi guru menambah 了 di akhir, karena 昨天 sudah terjadi.")),
    Q("p. 37", ("Which sentence is correct?", "Kalimat mana yang benar?"), ["他去了上海参观。", "他去上海参观了。"], 1,
      ("Serial verbs: no 了 after the first verb; 了 goes at the end.", "Kata kerja berangkai: tanpa 了 sesudah kata kerja pertama; 了 di akhir.")),
